# M7 flow (D-107; Stage 9 "Finale and ending"): START through every phase
# of the ending at the first frame it counts, in the real stage. Title
# flow with the run started in Café Zauner (the route's last station):
# START (21), the intro, cafe_zauner_solver.replay unchanged from 171:
# the boss beaten, the goal_stollen touched in the air (2441), the Serve,
# the tally and the clear panel; the ending's Map from 2879. A press at
# 2885 is ignored (the first 30 frames of a phase); then START at the
# first allowed frame of each phase (30 frames in, 60 in the Bill and
# Ende): Map -> Scene 2909, -> Bill 2939, -> Credits 2999, page by page
# (3029, 3059, 3089, 3119, 3149), -> Ende 3179, -> the title 3239 with
# the „durchgespielt" mark; the replay ends on it (3269), with no press
# on the marked title (E50: START counts there from its frame 60). The
# ending's frames follow the solver route and the tally: a re-solve
# moves every press.
level  = cafe_zauner
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = complete frames=2441..2441 deaths=0 no_event=Hurt
expect = state=title cleared=true stage=cafe_zauner score=0 lives=3 oblaten=0 power=normal
